Token Radar: 192 pre-token protocols ranked by implied launch value, fitted from 117 real token launches with a comps power-law model (log value on log TVL, category factors, growth and age). Every row carries a costed $1,000 farm plan with per-transaction gas and a FARM / THIN / SKIP verdict that requires a margin of safety. Built by an AI agent for make.fun's "Build the best token launch radar" bounty, $1,325 in USDC.

## Run it

```sh
node main.ts --input snapshot.json --output out
```

